{"created": "2024-11-18T19:47:56.022312+00:00", "modified": "2024-11-18T19:47:56.439690+00:00", "id": 14182446, "conceptrecid": "13937111", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14182446", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.13937111", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14182446", "metadata": {"title": "A Dataset of sEMG and Self-Perceived Fatigue Levels for Muscle Fatigue Analysis", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14182446", "publication_date": "2024-11-18", "description": "<p>Muscle fatigue is a risk factor for injuries in athletes and workers. This brings relevance to the study of this biochemical process to allow its identification and prevention.</p>\n<p>This dataset contains raw surface electromyographic (sEMG) data collected using the Delsys Trigno system, focusing on eight muscles, four per arm,&nbsp; from 13 healthy adult participants. Participants performed a series of 12 upper-body dynamic movements, consisting of 4 uni-articular and 2 complex/compound movements per arm.&nbsp; In addition to raw sEMG data, the dataset includes participants' self-reported fatigue levels.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Data Structure:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>sEMG Data.zip:</strong> Recorded in 1259 Hz, formatted as .csv.</li>\n<li><strong>self_perceived_fatigue_index.zip:</strong> Time-stamped fatigue ratings in 0-2 level, recorded at 50hz.</li>\n<li><strong>Protocol:</strong> Includes trial description, movements illustration and sampling frequencies.</li>\n<li><strong>Code</strong>: Jupyter Notebook file containing the base code to read and compute classic fatigue metrics such as Median Frequency and Mean Frequency.</li>\n<li><strong>Metadata:</strong> Includes participant anthropometrics, exercise habits and caffeine intake on the day of the trials.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This dataset may contribute to the testing of new fatigue detection algorithms and analysis of the underlying mechanisms.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Cerqueira, Sara", "affiliation": "University of Minho", "orcid": "0000-0002-8097-5507"}, {"name": "Vilas-Boas, Rita", "affiliation": "University of Minho"}, {"name": "Figueiredo, Joana", "affiliation": "University of Minho", "orcid": "0000-0001-9547-3051"}, {"name": "Santos, Cristina", "affiliation": "University of Minho", "orcid": "0000-0003-0023-7203"}], "contributors": [{"name": "Figueiredo, Joana", "affiliation": "University of Minho", "type": "ProjectLeader"}, {"name": "Santos, Cristina", "affiliation": "University of Minho", "type": "ProjectLeader", "orcid": "0000-0003-0023-7203"}, {"name": "Sara, Cerqueira", "affiliation": "University of Minho", "type": "DataCurator", "orcid": "0000-0002-8097-5507"}, {"name": "Rita, Vilas Boas", "affiliation": "University of Minho", "type": "DataCollector"}], "keywords": ["muscle fatigue", "sEMG"], "dates": [{"type": "updated", "description": "Metadata file was updated"}], "version": "v2", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "alternate_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://www.cmems.uminho.pt/projeto/fair-fatigue-and-ergonomics-perception-for-human-care-intelligent-collaborative-robot/"}], "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "2022.05844.PTDC.", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100001871::2022.05844.PTDC.", "funder": {"name": "Funda\u00e7\u00e3o para a Ci\u00eancia e Tecnologia", "doi": "10.13039/501100001871", "acronym": "FCT"}, "title": "FAIR: Fatigue and ergonomics perception for human-care Intelligent collaborative Robot"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "13937111"}}]}}, "title": "A Dataset of sEMG and Self-Perceived Fatigue Levels for Muscle Fatigue Analysis", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14182446", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14182446", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14182446?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zeno